    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="overview" class="doc-h2">1. Overview</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Comserv already has several AI plans. They do not agree on what to do next. This coordinator does not replace AIMPS, V2MIG, or AGENTS. It <strong>orders</strong> their remaining todos so AI use on the system improves in one sequence: focus the agents and models first, then the in-app picker, then the agent runtime, then operational agents.</p>
            <div class="doc-info">
                <p class="doc-body"><strong>Assumptions (correct in-app if wrong):</strong> parent is <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=114" class="doc-link">#114 AIC-ENH</a>. AGENTS #267 and V2MIG #259 stay top-level owners of their work. Cross-plan items are raised on the owning plan, never absorbed here.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="doc-body">Open this plan standalone: <a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/AISYSTEMPlan') %]" class="doc-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/Documentation/AISYSTEMPlan</a>.</p>
            <div class="doc-success">
                <p class="doc-body"><strong>Open the attached project and tracking todo</strong> (hover a link for what it is):</p>
                <div class="doc-navrow">
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=280" class="doc-navlink" title="Opens project #280 AISYSTEM — the database project this plan is attached to. Parent is #114 AIC-ENH.">Project #280 AISYSTEM (attached project)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo') %]?project_id=280" class="doc-navlink" title="Lists every todo whose project_id is 280 (AISYSTEM waves plus the Todo-create agent).">Todos on #280 (work list)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2217" class="doc-navlink" title="Opens todo #2217. Tracks the in-chat job that WRITES a todo into the database (code now). Not a form page.">Todo #2217 (Todo-create — code now)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2218" class="doc-navlink" title="Opens todo #2218. Scheduler agent: blockers and queue-aware start dates. Specified, not built. Not bulk reschedule.">Todo #2218 (Scheduler — specified)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2313" class="doc-navlink" title="SuperGrok first; never OpenRouter Grok.">Todo #2313 (SuperGrok-first routing)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2292" class="doc-navlink" title="OpenRouter 503 retry then fallback.">Todo #2292 (503 retry)</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=121" class="doc-navlink" title="AIC-004 AI Logic Integration — invoice chat, Router.">Project #121 AIC-004</a>
                    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/MASTER_PLAN') %]" class="doc-navlink" title="Returns to the Master Plan coordinator, which indexes every active plan including this one.">Master Plan (index of all plans)</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="now" class="doc-h2">Now (2026-09-25 — aisystem worktree)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body"><strong>Current.</strong> <code>/ai/usage</code> is a five-number SuperGrok overview (Build % used, remaining, daily cap, used today, days to reset) plus four agent cards; charts and the rest start closed. Daily guard no longer treats the first grok.com reading today as <code>day_start</code>. It measures yesterday + today from <code>grokcom_usage_history.jsonl</code> against remaining÷days until <strong>2026-10-01 10:31 PDT</strong>. If either day is over cap (or week Build ≥ 90%), SuperGrok is off for the rest of today; new Hermes sessions go to OpenRouter <code>cohere/north-mini-code:free</code>. Restore <code>grok-build-0.1</code> next PDT day only if week &lt; 90%. This chat stays on its current model until a new session. Chart bar/line toggle persists in localStorage (default bar).</p>
            <p class="doc-body"><strong>Blocked.</strong> Do not restart <code>:4006</code>. grok.com ≠ x.ai; no cookies; no Grok Bot API; no <code>opencode-free</code>. Do not grow <code>AI.pm</code>. Live path is templates/JS + <code>/static/ai/grokcom_usage.json</code> + <code>supergrok_guard.json</code>.</p>
            <p class="doc-body"><strong>Next.</strong> Hard-refresh <code>/ai/usage</code>. Keep grok.com Usage tab open. Start a new Hermes chat to pick up the free default. Handoff: <code>.hermes/plans/2026-09-25-aisystem-usage-grokcom-guard.md</code>.</p>
            <p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#toc">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

