            <h2 id="order" class="doc-h2">3. Wave order (do not skip ahead)</h2>
            <p class="doc-body">Each wave is a <strong>sub-project</strong>. Coordinator todos below point at owning-plan record_ids. Work those ids; do not clone the work here.</p>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <tr>
                    <th class="doc-th">Wave</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Why this next</th>
                    <th class="doc-th">Gate</th>
                </tr>
